  return (
    /**
     * @&#8203;type {...}
     */ expresssion
  );
}
```

##### Add support for Vue "Generic Components" ([#&#8203;15066](https://togithub.com/prettier/prettier/pull/15066) by [@&#8203;auvred](https://togithub.com/auvred))

https://blog.vuejs.org/posts/vue-3-3#generic-components

<!-- prettier-ignore -->

```vue
